give @p written_book[written_book_content={title:"Angling in the Fishing Frontier",author:"B.B.",generation:0,pages:[[{"text":"Welcome to the ","shadow_color":-1,"bold":false,"underlined":false},{"text":"\nFishing Frontier!\n","shadow_color":-6710887,"color":"aqua","bold":true,"italic":false,"underlined":true},{"text":"This book will be your guide for getting geared up to explore every river, lake, and ocean in your world. You'll be able to net the most dangerous catch, dredge the depths for lost treasures and more.","shadow_color":-1,"bold":false,"underlined":false}],[{"text":"Table of Contents\n","bold":true,"underlined":true},{"text":"Fisherman's Gear\n","color":"gold","bold":false,"underlined":false,"click_event":{"action":"change_page","page":3}},{"text":"Enchantments\n","color":"light_purple","bold":false,"italic":false,"underlined":false,"click_event":{"action":"change_page","page":6}},{"text":"Important Note!\n","color":"red","bold":false,"underlined":false,"click_event":{"action":"change_page","page":11}},{"text":"Regional Catches\n","color":"gold","bold":true,"underlined":false,"click_event":{"action":"change_page","page":12}},{"text":"Live Catch\n","color":"dark_aqua","bold":true,"underlined":false,"click_event":{"action":"change_page","page":16}},{"text":"Live Catch (Water)\n","bold":false,"underlined":false,"click_event":{"action":"change_page","page":17}},{"text":"Live Catch (Nether)\n","bold":false,"underlined":false,"click_event":{"action":"change_page","page":20}},{"text":"Treasure Hunter\n","bold":false,"underlined":false,"click_event":{"action":"change_page","page":21}},{"text":"Final notes","color":"dark_gray","bold":true,"underlined":false,"click_event":{"action":"change_page","page":26}}],[{"text":" Fisherman's Gear\n","shadow_color":-6710887,"color":"gold","bold":true},{"text":"\nThe Fisherman’s Gear armor set is the core progression system of the pack, and how you advance your fishing experience! Each piece gives you one luck (stacking), and each higher luck count unlocks the next gear piece and loot tier!","shadow_color":-1,"color":"black","bold":false}],{"text":"For example, with Fisherman's Boots and Fisherman's Leggings on, you will have 2 luck, allowing you to catch items in tier 0, 1, and 2!\nWith only one piece, you only have access to to tier 0 and 1.","shadow_color":-1,"color":"black"},{"text":"With 4 pieces of Fisherman's Gear in total, you're welcome to customize the trim, dye the gear, and give it any enchantments you want! \n\nFish in your own fashion!","shadow_color":-1,"color":"black"},[{"text":"New Enchantments\n\n","color":"light_purple","underlined":true},{"text":"Fireproof Line\n\n","shadow_color":-7697782,"color":"red","bold":true,"underlined":false},{"text":"Add this to your fishing rod to gain access to Lava Fishing. It's exactly like normal fishing, but with a distinct smokey flavor! Don't forget to see what's swimming in the Nether!","shadow_color":-1,"color":"black","bold":false,"italic":false,"underlined":false}],[{"text":"Live Catch\n\n","shadow_color":-6710887,"color":"dark_aqua","bold":true},{"text":"This enchantment gives you the ability to fish up live mobs! There are vanilla and unique mobs that have special loot. Max level is III. It is mutually exclusive with Treasure Hunter.","shadow_color":-1,"color":"black","bold":false}],[{"text":"Treasure Hunter\n\n","shadow_color":-7697782,"color":"gold","bold":true},{"text":"This enchantment puts some extra weight on your bobber, letting you hook sunken treasure! Pull up all kinds of loot crates. Max level is III. Mutually exclusive with Live Catch.","shadow_color":-1,"color":"black","bold":false}],[{"text":"Fisherman's Luck\n","shadow_color":-10066330,"color":"light_purple","obfuscated":true},{"text":"\nIt's rumored across the frontier that there's an enchantment that can make anyone a mighty angler!","shadow_color":-1,"color":"black","underlined":false,"obfuscated":false}],[{"text":"   LAVA FISHING\n\n","shadow_color":-6710887,"color":"dark_red"},{"text":"You can fish in lava using the same space requirements as normal fishing. There's even more loot to catch inside the ","shadow_color":-1,"color":"black"},{"text":"Nether","shadow_color":-1,"color":"red"},{"text":", which is all listed in the next sections alongside Overworld lava fishing.","shadow_color":-1,"color":"black","bold":false}],[{"text":"You might come across some rods with ","shadow_color":-1842205,"color":"#1499FF"},{"text":"unusually high","shadow_color":-11711155,"color":"red","bold":true},{"text":" level enchantments. When combining these with other rods, always place the higher level on the left, and make sure the right item has no similar enchantment at a lower level. Be careful and double check your items!","shadow_color":-1842205,"color":"#1499FF"}],[{"text":" Regional Catches\n\n","shadow_color":-6710887,"color":"gold","bold":true,"italic":false},{"text":"This section details which biomes have additional things to fish up beyond the normal fare. They are listed in no particular order and can be caught with any rod.","shadow_color":-1,"color":"black","bold":false,"underlined":false}],[{"text":"Underground (y:40 - y:-2)\n\n","shadow_color":-7697782,"bold":true},{"text":"Deep Underground (y:-3 and below)\n\n","shadow_color":-7697782,"color":"black","bold":true},{"text":"Lush Caves\n\n","shadow_color":-6710887,"color":"green","bold":true},{"text":"Deep Dark\n\n","shadow_color":-16578806,"color":"dark_gray","bold":true},{"text":"Dripstone Caves\n\n","shadow_color":-6710887,"color":"gold","bold":true}],[{"text":"Mountains\n\n","shadow_color":-7697782,"color":"gray","bold":true},{"text":"Rivers\n\n","shadow_color":-7697782,"color":"blue","bold":true},{"text":"Warm Ocean\n\n","shadow_color":-7697782,"color":"aqua","bold":true},{"text":"Any Oceans\n\n","shadow_color":-6710887,"color":"dark_blue"},{"text":"Cold Biomes\n\n","shadow_color":-7697782,"color":"aqua","bold":true},{"text":"Mushroom Island\n\n","color":"#775796"}],[{"text":"Forested Biomes\n\n","shadow_color":-7697782,"color":"green","bold":true},{"text":"Flower Forest\n\n","shadow_color":-3355444,"color":"green","bold":true},{"text":"Jungles\n\n","shadow_color":-3355444,"color":"dark_green","bold":true},{"text":"Swamps\n\n","shadow_color":-3355444,"color":"dark_aqua"},{"text":"Badlands\n\n","shadow_color":-6710887,"color":"gold","bold":true},{"text":"Deserts\n\n","shadow_color":-7697782,"color":"yellow","bold":true},{"text":"THE END","color":"dark_purple","bold":true}],[{"text":"Live Catch\n\n","color":"dark_aqua","bold":true},{"text":"The following two sections will tell you which biomes of the frontier have additional unique live catch options. We'll tell you where to go, but you have to discover what's there!","color":"black","bold":false}],[{"text":"Water Live Catch\n\n","color":"dark_blue","bold":true},{"text":"Tier 0\n","color":"black","bold":false,"underlined":true},{"text":"\nMushroom Island\nSwamps\nLush Caves\nCold Biomes\n\nUnderground (y level 40 and lower, this entry also has a variant for every tier)","color":"black","bold":false,"underlined":false}],["",{"text":"Tier 1:\n","shadow_color":-1842205,"color":"gold","underlined":true},{"text":"Pillager Outpost\n\nUnderground(y level 40 and below)\n\nSwamps","shadow_color":-1842205,"color":"gold","underlined":false}],[{"text":"Tier 2\n","shadow_color":-1842205,"color":"#1499FF","underlined":true},{"text":"The End\nSwamps\n\n","shadow_color":-1842205,"color":"#1499FF","underlined":false},{"text":"Tier 3\n","shadow_color":-1842205,"color":"dark_purple","underlined":true},{"text":"Oceans\nThe End\n\n","shadow_color":-1842205,"color":"dark_purple","underlined":false},{"text":"Tier 4\n","shadow_color":-1842205,"color":"#27A800"},{"text":"N/A","shadow_color":-1842205,"color":"#27A800","italic":true,"underlined":false}],[{"text":"Nether Live Catch\n\n","color":"dark_red","bold":true},{"text":"Tier 0\n\n","color":"black","bold":false,"underlined":true},{"text":"Basalt Delta\nso